{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Avoid the remaining plain-sampler preflight call.** For an undecided complete remote parent, this still invokes the visible sampler with `Workflow` before the real `Invocation` and `Workflow` spans invoke it again. Stateful or rate-limited samplers consequently consume an extra decision and can produce a different span set. Remove this preflight or make its result authoritative for SDK spans, and update the remote-parent sampler test to expect only real-span evaluations.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-Kro0","finding_digest":"4817f8f1a3bdbef06e7387a0c3d68ff75375b61b6f611c683891900194b4c061","finding_id":"arf_v1_jal7r4ndxw7pa3ttq6qmhvup65","finding_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","identity_key":"otel-plugin/otelpluginsupport::resolvesamplingresult::visible-replacement-preflight-sampling","line":198,"observation_digest":"941ab3375691c9e9a90b36bf7f9164fd3357bb1f7effe7267d449c73584c4003","observation_id":"aro_v1_sqnlgn2wshe6tkilg27x7ele7u","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_jal7r4ndxw7pa3ttq6qmhvup65","published_at":"2026-10-13T21:27:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_csqr3tgy2h6bfjfq33nutwfx7g","reviewed_base_sha":"45e4ef4720f96e0ebb348c63d43aa3eb785341eb","reviewed_head_sha":"ef905e8912325c465ff4ecc5bbb50f665265ba13","reviewer":"codex","start_line":195,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_7wdi2vacag2faswodsin6ajfbg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T21:27:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
